{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120023112306-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120032929\"/><p>昨日(19日)下午5時許，山頂柯士甸山道一獨立屋外傭報案，指懷疑上址遭爆竊。警員接報到場，發現上址一房間窗戶被撬。經初步點算，相信上址有4個名牌手袋不見了，價值有待進一步確定。經初步調查，案件列「爆竊」，暫未有人被捕。據了解，4個手袋的價值共約15萬港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T19:44:18.473538+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T18:31:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T20:57:16.415642+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T19:37:48.386463+00:00","content_hash":"6dd3243965bbbbba46eb67ddae3526a32f30cfc182d6547535c55956926c7bae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}